{"pin":"BH00017","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00017","anchor":"","first_line":"O 'Andalib! Hearken unto the Call, for verily it appeareth at one time in the name of the Beloved, and at another time in Mine Own name, the Well-Beloved, and again at times [3.5s]... ...The Hand of Omnipotence hath established His Revelation upon an unassailable, an enduring foundation. Storms of human strife are powerless to undermine its basis… O people of the earth! Make not the religion of God a cause of variance among you. ","first_line_orig":"یا عندلیب اسمع الندآء انه یظهر مره باسم الحبیب و اخری باسمی المحبوب و تاره  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"8350","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://d9263461.github.io/cl/Baha'i/Others/ROB/V2/Contents.html\"\u003eROB2.333\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#51\"\u003eLL#051\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#342\"\u003eLL#342\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15691.040","source":"BLIB_Or15691","locator":"040"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15715.066c","source":"BLIB_Or15715","locator":"066c"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15729.028","source":"BLIB_Or15729","locator":"028"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BSB.Cod.arab.2644 p037v","source":"BSB","locator":"Cod.arab.2644 p037v"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"Berlin1237#12","source":"Berlin1237","locator":"12","url":"https://digital.staatsbibliothek-berlin.de/werkansicht?PPN=PPN1740194756\u0026PHYSID=PHYS_0007"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"MKI4522.066","source":"MKI4522","locator":"066"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_22848:066","source":"NLAI_2284